From 501e037dc89e4ee87323fdf319fe299116ac10d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:51:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 0144: HUD editor drags in 1280x720 design space; in-game
 editor is a drag editor like the pad settings

---
 dm/ios/Sources/HudEditor.swift | 227 +++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 159 insertions(+), 68 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dm/ios/Sources/HudEditor.swift b/dm/ios/Sources/HudEditor.swift
index 130791b..5025d30 100644
--- a/dm/ios/Sources/HudEditor.swift
+++ b/dm/ios/Sources/HudEditor.swift
